# React Dev

When editing StoreDesk Electron React/TypeScript:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/react-dev/SKILL.md` for typed props, events, hooks, and components.
2. For deep dives, open files under `.cursor/skills/react-dev/references/` or `examples/` (prefer `react-router.md` over TanStack Router).
3. Skip Server Components / Server Actions patterns unless the user is explicitly building an RSC app — Electron is client-side.
4. For UI layout/styling also apply `.cursor/skills/mui/` and `.cursor/skills/storedesk-ui/`.
5. Prefer specific event types (`ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>`, etc.) and avoid `any` on handlers.
